{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-master-protocols","title":"博士临床研究 — 平台试验与主方案试验","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/clinical-research-advanced/trial-design/platform-master-protocols","wordCount":1977,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士临床研究-平台试验与主方案试验\">博士临床研究 — 平台试验与主方案试验</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>主方案试验（Master Protocol）是在单一统筹性协议下同时评价多种治疗和/或多种疾病的临床试验框架。根据结构差异，主方案试验可细分为三种类型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>伞式试验（Umbrella Trial）</strong>：一种疾病 × 多种治疗，按生物标志物分层。每个亚型-治疗组合相当于一个独立的子试验</li>\n<li><strong>篮式试验（Basket Trial）</strong>：一种治疗 × 多种疾病（或分子亚型），评估同一靶向治疗在不同组织学类型中的活性</li>\n<li><strong>平台试验（Platform Trial）</strong>：持续运营的基础设施，治疗臂可动态进出，共享对照组和运营资源</li>\n</ul>\n<p>平台试验与传统试验的根本区别在于其&quot;永续&quot;特征——试验不随某个治疗的评价结束而终止，而是作为持续运营的评价平台不断引入新臂。这种模式在 COVID-19 期间通过 RECOVERY、SOLIDARITY 和 REMAP-CAP 三大试验得到了大规模验证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 伞式试验&#10;        D1[一种疾病] --&gt; B1[标志物 A]&#10;        D1 --&gt; B2[标志物 B]&#10;        D1 --&gt; B3[标志物 C]&#10;        B1 --&gt; T1[治疗 1]&#10;        B2 --&gt; T2[治疗 2]&#10;        B3 --&gt; T3[治疗 3]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 篮式试验&#10;        T4[一种治疗] --&gt; C1[癌种 A]&#10;        T4 --&gt; C2[癌种 B]&#10;        T4 --&gt; C3[癌种 C]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 平台试验&#10;        P[持续平台] --&gt; A1[臂 1 进入]&#10;        P --&gt; A2[臂 2 进入]&#10;        P --&gt; A3[臂 3 进入]&#10;        A1 --&gt;|毕业/淘汰| P&#10;        A2 --&gt;|毕业/淘汰| P&#10;        A3 --&gt;|新臂替补| P&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 伞式试验\n        D1[一种疾病] --&gt; B1[标志物 A]\n        D1 --&gt; B2[标志物 B]\n        D1 --&gt; B3[标志物 C]\n        B1 --&gt; T1[治疗 1]\n        B2 --&gt; T2[治疗 2]\n        B3 --&gt; T3[治疗 3]\n    end\n    subgraph 篮式试验\n        T4[一种治疗] --&gt; C1[癌种 A]\n        T4 --&gt; C2[癌种 B]\n        T4 --&gt; C3[癌种 C]\n    end\n    subgraph 平台试验\n        P[持续平台] --&gt; A1[臂 1 进入]\n        P --&gt; A2[臂 2 进入]\n        P --&gt; A3[臂 3 进入]\n        A1 --&gt;|毕业/淘汰| P\n        A2 --&gt;|毕业/淘汰| P\n        A3 --&gt;|新臂替补| P\n    end</pre><p>主方案试验面临的核心统计挑战包括共享对照组的多重性控制、不同子试验间的信息借力（Bayesian Hierarchical Borrowing）、非并行入组臂之间的时间趋势偏倚，以及动态环境下操作特性的模拟验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"共享对照组的统计效率与偏倚权衡\">共享对照组的统计效率与偏倚权衡</h3><p>平台试验的效率增益主要来自共享对照组——多个实验臂共用同一控制组，减少总体所需样本量。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个实验臂各需与对照组比较，传统两臂试验共需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K \\times 2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 例患者，而共享对照组设计仅需约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><msqrt><mi>K</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K \\times n + n\\sqrt{K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1133em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 例。</p>\n<p>但共享带来相关性问题。若两个实验臂 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 共享对照组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，则估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\theta}_A = \\bar{Y}_A - \\bar{Y}_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1079em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\theta}_B = \\bar{Y}_B - \\bar{Y}_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1079em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不再独立，因为共享了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{Y}_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的随机变异。这导致：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Corr</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Corr}(\\hat{\\theta}_A, \\hat{\\theta}_B) = \\frac{n_C / K}{n_T + n_C / K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Corr</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每个实验臂的样本量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是对照组总量。多重性调整需要考虑这种相关结构——Dunnett 检验或基于重采样的闭合检验是常用方法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"非并行对照与时间趋势\">非并行对照与时间趋势</h3><p>在平台试验中，不同实验臂的入组时间窗可能不重叠。实验臂 A 可能在 2020 年入组完成，而实验臂 D 在 2022 年才开始，但两者可能共享同一池对照组数据。如果患者特征或标准治疗在此期间发生变化（时间漂移），直接共享将引入偏倚。</p>\n<p>应对策略包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仅并行对照</td>\n<td>每个臂只与同期入组的对照比较</td>\n<td>丧失效率增益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间分层分析</td>\n<td>将入组时期作为分层因素</td>\n<td>需要足够的每层样本量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回归调整</td>\n<td>在模型中纳入入组时间（线性或样条）</td>\n<td>假设时间效应形式正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贝叶斯动态借力</td>\n<td>随先验-数据一致性动态调整借力程度</td>\n<td>需要复杂的先验标定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>REMAP-CAP 试验采用贝叶斯自适应方法，在多个治疗域（如抗病毒、抗炎、抗凝）之间进行析因式评估，同时通过区域和时期分层控制时间混杂。</p>\n<h3 id=\"治疗臂的进出机制\">治疗臂的进出机制</h3><p>平台试验的运营核心是治疗臂的动态管理：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>臂进入（Arm Entry）</strong>：新臂通过独立的科学委员会审核加入平台。要求包括临床前证据充分性、药物供应保障和资助方协议</li>\n<li><strong>中期评估</strong>：预设的贝叶斯或频率学决策规则，在固定信息节点或连续监测模式下判定臂的去留</li>\n<li><strong>毕业（Graduation）</strong>：后验有效概率超过阈值（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>data</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\theta &gt; 0 | \\text{data}) &gt; 0.99</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">data</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span></span></span></span></span>），进入确证性试验或申请条件批准</li>\n<li><strong>淘汰（Dropping）</strong>：无效后验概率过高或预测成功概率极低</li>\n<li><strong>臂退出后的数据处理</strong>：已收集的数据继续贡献于对照组信息池和贝叶斯层级模型</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"里程碑案例\">里程碑案例</h3><p><strong>RECOVERY 试验</strong>（英国，2020-）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设计：开放标签平台试验，COVID-19 住院患者</li>\n<li>规模：超过 50,000 名入组患者，评价 12+ 种治疗</li>\n<li>核心发现：地塞米松降低重症死亡率（NNT=8）、托珠单抗进一步获益</li>\n<li>成功因素：极简化 CRF（仅一页）、嵌入 NHS 常规流程、快速随机化</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>I-SPY 2</strong>（美国，2010-）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设计：贝叶斯自适应平台，新辅助化疗 ± 实验药物</li>\n<li>分层：10 个 HR/HER2/MammaPrint 生物标志物亚型</li>\n<li>成果：5+ 种药物毕业进入 III 期，平均评价时间比传统试验缩短 50%</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>GBM AGILE</strong>（全球，2019-）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设计：胶质母细胞瘤贝叶斯自适应平台</li>\n<li>特色：响应自适应随机化 + MGMT 甲基化分层 + 生存终点的贝叶斯模型</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"监管与运营挑战\">监管与运营挑战</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>详情</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>知识产权</td>\n<td>多家药企的实验药物在同一平台竞争，数据共享与商业机密的平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多国监管</td>\n<td>不同国家对共享对照和自适应随机化的接受程度不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据管理</td>\n<td>动态臂进出要求高度灵活的 EDC 系统和统计分析计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应链</td>\n<td>多种实验药物的供应、标签和分配同步管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>治理结构</td>\n<td>独立数据监查委员会（IDMC）需同时监管多个比较</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一项肿瘤篮式试验：靶向 BRAF V600E 突变，覆盖黑色素瘤、结直肠癌和甲状腺癌三个篮子。请确定每个篮子的样本量、是否允许篮子间信息借力（讨论层级模型 vs. 独立分析的利弊），以及毕业/淘汰规则。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某平台试验的对照组已积累 500 例数据（入组期 2020-2022），现在 2024 年一个新实验臂加入。讨论直接使用全部 500 例 vs. 仅使用 2023-2024 年并行对照的效率与偏倚权衡，并提出一种动态折扣方案。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 RECOVERY 的极简化频率学设计与 I-SPY 2 的贝叶斯自适应设计在以下维度上的差异：(a) 样本量效率，(b) 操作复杂度，(c) 监管接受度，(d) 适用的疾病领域。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在平台试验中，如果一个实验臂因安全信号被紧急撤除，其已入组患者的数据应如何处理？讨论 ITT 原则与数据完整性的平衡。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Woodcock &amp; LaVange (2017)</strong>：<em>Master protocols to study multiple therapies, multiple diseases, or both</em>（NEJM）— 主方案试验分类学的经典论文</li>\n<li><strong>Park et al. (2019)</strong>：<em>Systematic review of basket trials, umbrella trials, and platform trials</em>（Lancet Oncology）— 全面的系统综述</li>\n<li><strong>RECOVERY Trial Protocol</strong>：公开可获取，是大规模平台试验方案设计的范本</li>\n<li><strong>Berry et al. (2015)</strong>：<em>Bayesian clinical trials</em>（Nature Reviews Drug Discovery）— 贝叶斯方法在平台试验中的应用综述</li>\n<li><strong>EU-PEARL 项目</strong>：欧盟资助的平台试验基础设施标准化项目，提供治理模板和统计工具</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>平台试验与主方案试验代表了临床试验设计从&quot;一次一药&quot;走向&quot;系统化评价&quot;的范式转变。通过共享基础设施、对照组和运营资源，这类试验在效率、成本和速度上实现了质的飞跃。篮式、伞式和平台试验各有适用场景，而共享对照的多重性控制、时间趋势偏倚处理和治理结构设计是成功实施的技术关键。COVID-19 大流行中 RECOVERY 和 REMAP-CAP 的成功，已将平台试验从方法学创新推向了临床实践的主流。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士临床研究 — 平台试验与主方案试验","id":"博士临床研究-平台试验与主方案试验"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"共享对照组的统计效率与偏倚权衡","id":"共享对照组的统计效率与偏倚权衡"},{"level":3,"text":"非并行对照与时间趋势","id":"非并行对照与时间趋势"},{"level":3,"text":"治疗臂的进出机制","id":"治疗臂的进出机制"},{"level":3,"text":"里程碑案例","id":"里程碑案例"},{"level":3,"text":"监管与运营挑战","id":"监管与运营挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士临床研究 — 贝叶斯临床试验","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/clinical-research-advanced/trial-design/bayesian-clinical-trials"},"next":{"title":"博士临床研究 — 观察性研究中的因果推断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/clinical-research-advanced/real-world-evidence/causal-inference-observational"}}